17 owner delivery/environment controls, and the owning locked commitlint policy. Normal source CI must complete before delivery; this PR creates no release or tag.\n\n<!-- CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> **Low Risk**\n> CI registration only (failing stub workflow) plus test fixture updates; no runtime release or auth changes in application code.\n> \n> **Overview**\n> Adds a **Release** GitHub Actions workflow (`.github/workflows/build-release.yml`) that can be **manually dispatched** with **no workflow permissions**, so the default branch carries the maintenance publisher entry point GitHub expects. The lone job **always fails** and tells operators to run publication from the reviewed **4.44.x maintenance branch** instead—nothing is published from default.\n> \n> **Tests** in `test_platform_support.py` update strict and legacy `verify_packages` calls to pass the full publication context (`package-payloads`, repository, artifact run/id/digest) and assert that verification materializes **`package-publication`** with matching file maps and archive SHA256.\n> \n> <sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit 6c622123470b65cefbfc2326aeeee34a89b597a2. Bugbot is set up for automated code reviews on this repo. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\n<!-- /CURSOR_SUMMARY -->","created_at":"2026-11-17T15:00:17Z","updated_at":"2026-11-17T15:48:28Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"fafe8f13ee8ccfa82bd3de82125ca255eda89c35","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/pulls/187/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/pulls/187/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/issues/187/comments","st